Name: cjs-module-lexer
Short Name: cjs_module_lexer
URL: https://github.com/nodejs/cjs-module-lexer
Version: 2.3.0
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Node.js CommonJS named-export and re-export detection. Xenon's ESM loader uses
the synchronous JavaScript implementation to discover namespace exports before
evaluation, preserving CommonJS side-effect ordering during graph linking.

Source:
https://registry.npmjs.org/cjs-module-lexer/-/cjs-module-lexer-2.3.0.tgz
