Local Modifications:
None. lexer.js, package.json and LICENSE are byte-for-byte copies of the npm archive.
The host bootstrap supplies a lexical CommonJS module object around lexer.js;
no WebAssembly, external Node runtime, network access, or package installation
is required at runtime.
